1
00:00:00,630 --> 00:00:04,460
(Raj:)Go out with me on one date
and I promise you you'll see.

2
00:00:06,937 --> 00:00:08,267
(Leonard:)Okay.

3
00:00:08,438 --> 00:00:10,908
(Girl:)Text me.
Bye.

4
00:00:11,975 --> 00:00:15,175
(Raj:)You won't regret it.
I'm the most pathetic guy you've ever met.

5
00:00:17,447 --> 00:00:21,477
(Raj:)And that, boys and girls, is how it's done.

6
00:00:28,425 --> 00:00:30,895
(Penny(as Blanche DuBois):)You love her very much, don't you?

7
00:00:31,294 --> 00:00:32,694
(Raj:)Yes.

8
00:00:32,896 --> 00:00:35,386
I think you have great capacity for devotion.

9
00:00:36,166 --> 00:00:39,136
You will be Ionely
when she passes on, won't you?

10
00:00:40,837 --> 00:00:42,427
(Penny:)I understand what that is.

11
00:00:42,939 --> 00:00:45,199
- To be Ionely?
- She's pretty good, huh?

12
00:00:45,408 --> 00:00:46,668
(Sheldon:)She is.

13
00:00:47,444 --> 00:00:49,934
(Sheldon:)But when do they get to the part
about streetcars?

14
00:00:53,483 --> 00:00:55,513
(Penny(as Blanche):)When I was a very young girl.

15
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:59,990
(Penny(as Blanche):)When I was 16 years old,
I made the discovery:

16
00:01:00,657 --> 00:01:01,677
(Raj:)Love.

17
00:01:03,493 --> 00:01:06,983
(Penny(as Blanche):)All at once and much, much too completely.

18
00:01:07,931 --> 00:01:10,521
It was like you turned
a blinding light on something...

19
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:12,570
(Penny(as Blanche):)...that had always been half a shadow.

20
00:01:14,004 --> 00:01:16,164
(Penny(as Blanche):)That's how it struck the world for me.

21
00:01:18,308 --> 00:01:20,208
(Penny(as Blanche):)But I was unlucky.

22
00:01:21,044 --> 00:01:22,414
(Penny(as Blanche):)Deluded.

23
00:01:22,579 --> 00:01:25,009
- She's remarkable.
- She really is.

24
00:01:25,182 --> 00:01:26,372
(Amy:)Our Penny's a star.

25
00:01:28,018 --> 00:01:30,248
(Sheldon:)How can she remember all those lines...

26
00:01:30,453 --> 00:01:34,353
(Sheldon:)...but as a waitress, she can't remember
no tomato on my hamburger?

